<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>God’s Word is hidden in my heart!</l><l>God’s Word is hidden in my heart!</l><l>My heart is the good ground so</l><l>The Word of God can grow in me.</l><l>Growing! Growing! Growing!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
